# Local state and repository furniture. .vscodeignore is an allowlist by
# omission, so anything not named here ships — a workflow the test suite wrote
# into the working tree was packaged into the extension users download.
.cadre/**
.github/**

# The operating model is a design document for the original three-agent product,
# kept in the repository for its reasoning. Nothing reads it and nothing links to
# it, so shipping it only gives the reader a detailed account of a product they
# do not have.
docs/**
